# Cloudflare Workers static-assets redirects.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/
#
# Entries here must use RELATIVE URLs. A cross-hostname redirect is rejected
# at deploy time -- the whole deploy fails with:
#
#   Invalid _redirects configuration:
#   Line N: Only relative URLs are allowed. [code: 100324]
#
# (Pages allowed absolute URLs here; Workers does not. That difference cost
# two failed builds, so: no scheme, no hostname, in this file.)
#
# The apex -> www redirect therefore CANNOT live here. It is a Redirect Rule
# on the lightning-matrix.org zone instead -- dashboard, Rules -> Redirect
# Rules, the rule named "apex to www":
#
#   Match:  URI Full, wildcard   http*://lightning-matrix.org/*
#   Target: https://www.lightning-matrix.org/${2}
#   Status: 301, preserve query string
#
# Same-site path redirects DO belong here, one per line, for example:
#
#   /download   /#download   301
#
# No path redirects are needed yet -- the site is a single page.
